    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The community’s clubhouse boasts a ceramics room, arts and crafts area, woodworking shop, card room, billiards table, library, and kitchen, plus an Olympic‑sized pool and tennis courts.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
